    "sentence_translations": [
      "Lao Gan Ma Price Rise",
      "",
      "When it comes to the goddess of Chinese people, it isn’t a famous singer, nor is it a beautiful woman—it’s Lao Gan Ma.",
      "Lao Gan Ma is a famous chili sauce that is loved by many people because it’s both delicious and cheap.",
      "",
      "Lao Gan Ma is also very famous overseas and can be found in Chinese supermarkets.",
      "Even though the price is a little higher than it is in China, it’s still very cheap.",
      "",
      "However, the changes in the economy in recent years have become unbearable for Lao Gan Ma since it has not increased its prices for a long time.",
      "Recently, the Lao Gan Ma company decided that the price of all Lao Gan Ma products would increase.",
      "Chinese fans were immediately unhappy. The price of everything has gone up. When will salaries go up? No one knows the answer.",
      "",
      "If you are also a fan of Lao Gan Ma, go buy more before the price goes up!"
    ]
